# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
node_modules
**/node_modules/
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
**/.next/
/out/
**/out/

# production
/build
**/build/

# build outputs
/dist
**/dist/

# app logs (enterprise logging feature)
/logs
**/logs/

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
*.log.*
*.db

# python
__pycache__/

# upload files
/uploads/
**/uploads/

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*
!.env.example.local

# vercel
.vercel

# prisma
generated/
# 生成的合并 schema（由 prisma:merge 脚本生成，源文件在 prisma/schemas/ 下）
prisma/schema.prisma
**/prisma/schema.prisma

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# AI Code Tools related files
**/.jules/
**/.codex/
**/.claude/
**/.opencode/

# AI agent related files
**/.superpowers/
**/.openviking/
**/.sisyphus/
ov.conf
opencode.json
opencode.jsonc

# prompts
**/CLAUDE.md
**/AGENTS.md
!apps/*/AGENTS.md

# mcp
.mcp.json

# Git worktrees for isolated development
**/.worktrees/

# 自定义打包文件
dist/

# 版本发布相关文件
CHANGELOG.md
RELEASE_NOTES.md

# beads 相关文件
**/.dolt/
**/.beads/
.beads-credential-key

# 其他
**/backups/
**/exports/
